# godzilla_pro 1.15 - the port every other port is measured against (item 134).
# Every entry was located and emulator-proven with these values as constants in items
# 125-133; tools/spike2_emu/modes/MODE_API.md says how each was found. The instruction
# words on the `site` lines are read from the game ELF by port_words.py - never typed.
game           godzilla_pro
version        1.15

