# The three spinners each send THREE bits a spin, one dispatch each (MODE_API.md's census: 0x80 0x200
# 0x400 / 0x800 0x2000 0x4000 / 0x2_00008000 0x20000 0x40000); the MIDDLE bit is the one the game's
# own rules test (Ebirah's spin counts, read off this ELF: item 158), so it is the spinner's shot
# here (item 160). Not run on this build.
shot 0x200         Left spinner
shot 0x2000        Top spinner
shot 0x20000       Right spinner

